{"i":"jm1168960","k":["引き取る","引取る","引きとる"],"r":["ひきとる"],"s":[{"p":"v5r,vt","e":"to take into one's possession; to receive; to accept; to collect; to claim","z":"領取、收下","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"v5r,vt","e":"to take into one's care (e.g. person, pet); to take custody of; to adopt","z":"收留、領養","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"v5r,vt","e":"to leave; to go away; to withdraw; to get out","z":"離開、退下","zs":"subagent"}],"f":49.95533,"l":"","u":0,"x":["母が子犬を引き取って育てています。","母(はは)が子犬(こいぬ)を引(ひ)き取(と)って育(そだ)てています。","媽媽領養了小狗並照顧牠。","a"]}
