{"i":"jm1244950","k":["具"],"r":["ぐ"],"s":[{"p":"n","e":"tool; means","z":"工具、手段","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"n","e":"ingredients (added to soup, rice, etc.)","z":"配料","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"ctr","e":"counter for sets of armor, utensils, furniture, etc.","z":"盔甲、家具等的量詞","zs":"subagent"}],"f":49.94073,"l":"","u":0,"x":["スープの具は野菜と肉です。","スープの具(ぐ)は野菜(やさい)と肉(にく)です。","湯的配料是蔬菜和肉。","a"]}
