{"i":"jm1500100","k":["風呂"],"r":["ふろ"],"s":[{"p":"n","e":"bath; bathing; bathtub; bathroom","z":"洗澡、浴缸、浴室","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"n","e":"bathhouse; public bath","z":"澡堂","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"n","e":"room for drying lacquerware","z":"乾燥漆器的房間","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"n","e":"base (wooden joint connecting the blade of a hoe, spade, etc., to the handle)","z":"鋤頭柄的連接木件","zs":"subagent"}],"f":49.88772,"l":"","u":0,"x":["毎晩、ゆっくりお風呂に入ります。","毎晩(まいばん)、ゆっくりお風呂(ふろ)に入(はい)ります。","我每天晚上都慢慢地泡澡。","a"]}
