{"i":"jm1500330","k":["副"],"r":["ふく"],"s":[{"p":"n,pref","e":"assistant; associate; vice-; sub-; deputy; substitute; auxiliary; supplementary; additional; collateral","z":"副的、輔助的","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"n","e":"duplicate; copy","z":"副本、複本","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"n","e":"adverb","z":"副詞","zs":"subagent"}],"f":49.88766,"l":"","u":0,"x":["副担任の先生はとても優しいです。","副担任(ふくたんにん)の先生(せんせい)はとても優(やさ)しいです。","副班導師非常溫柔。","a"]}
