{"i":"jm2028970","k":[],"r":["か"],"s":[{"p":"prt","e":"indicates a question","z":"表示疑問","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"indicates an embedded question; indicates an indirect question","z":"表示間接疑問","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"or; whether or not; either ... or ...","z":"或是、是否","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"some- (e.g. something, someone)","z":"某(某人、某物)","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"hmm; huh; I wonder (if, why, etc.); it might (be); maybe; perhaps it's (because of); could it be (that)","z":"是嗎、我想知道","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"shouldn't we ...?; why don't we ...?; what about ...?; how about ...?; let's ...; may I ...?; could you ...?","z":"要不要…","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"some (amount); roughly; about; circa; more or less; or so","z":"大約、左右","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"won't you ...?; why don't you ...?; couldn't you (e.g. have done differently)?; shouldn't you ...?","z":"能不能請你…","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"why should ...?; why would ...?; would I (really) ...?; who could have (guessed, foreseen, etc.) ...?; how could ...?; how should ...?","z":"怎麼會…","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"OK?; (you) understand?; got it?; really?; right?; didn't (I, you, etc.) ...?","z":"懂了嗎、是嗎","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"oh; wow; how (incredible, strongly, badly, etc.)","z":"哦、哇","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"prt","e":"come to think of ...; ... you say?; ah; now that (you, it, etc.) ...","z":"說到…、對了","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"pref","e":"very","z":"非常","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"suf","e":"-al; -ial; -ic; -ical; -ish; -y","z":"…的(形容詞化)","zs":"subagent"},{"p":"adv","e":"in that way","z":"那樣地","zs":"subagent"}],"f":49.84737,"l":"","u":1,"x":["これは何ですか。","これは何(なん)ですか。","這是什麼？","a"]}
